 she works as a teacher at a secondary school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she has a strict and serious personality, she cannot hide the fact that she is a woman with a very strong sexual desire. She came to the Kouno family at about the same time as Miwa, but was mostly left alone by her husband."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also jealous of Miwa, who is admired by the main character, as she possesses her own wants both sexually and romantically."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is tormented by the gap between her rationality and the need to be a teacher and a sensible adult."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is a fan of the main protagonist's novels."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48391"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"中等学校で教職を務める、主人公の義母（父親の後妻）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳しくまじめな性格だが、非常に性欲の強い女であることが隠し切れない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美和とほぼ同時に向野家に来たが、夫にはほとんど放置されているような状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに主人公に慕われている美和への嫉妬、自分自身の持つ性を求める肉体と心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教職者であり良識ある大人であらねばという理性の狭間で心を悩ませている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10117","sourceWorkId":"23670","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"中等学校で教職を務める、主人公の義母（父親の後妻）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳しくまじめな性格だが、非常に性欲の強い女であることが隠し切れない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美和とほぼ同時に向野家に来たが、夫にはほとんど放置されているような状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに主人公に慕われている美和への嫉妬、自分自身の持つ性を求める肉体と心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教職者であり良識ある大人であらねばという理性の狭間で心を悩ませている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46461"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"121 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10117","sourceWorkId":"23670","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"p","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10117","sourceWorkId":"23670","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"167 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10117","sourceWorkId":"23670","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"9